OL,5,G0900 The Saturday Show
OL,6,     FAmy Irons and Steven Mill
OL,7,     Fkick-start your Saturday with lots
OL,8,     Fof laughs, great guests and
OL,9,     Ftimeless tunes as we look back on
OL,10,     Fthe week's news and preview the
OL,11,     Fday's football fixtures.
OL,12,G1200 Off the Ball
OL,13,     FThe most petty and ill-informed
OL,14,     Ffootball show on radio.
OL,15,G1400 Sportsound
OL,16,     FAll the action from the Scottish
OL,17,     FLeague Cup, with commentary from
OL,18,     FDundee v Clyde and updates from
OL,19,     Facross the country, plus all the
OL,20,     Flatest football news.
